            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1037-f3" n="3" xml:id="d1037-f3-content">
                <p>For Byrnes’ reply to this message,
                    following a conversation at the Berlin Conference between Mosely and Gusev, see <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref
                        target="#pg407">p. 407</ref>.</p>
            </note>
